          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thus it shall be done for each bull or ram, or for each of the male lambs or the kids. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "According to the number that you prepare, so shall you do with every one according to their number. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All who are native shall do these things in this way, in offering an offering by fire, a pleasing odor to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
