            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “But if you err, and do not observe all these commandments which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded you by Moses, from the day that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave commandment, and onward throughout your generations, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then if it was done unwittingly without the knowledge of the congregation, all the congregation shall offer one young bull for a burnt offering, a pleasing odor to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", with its cereal offering and its drink offering, according to the ordinance, and one male goat for a sin offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall make atonement for all the congregation of the people of Israel, and they shall be forgiven; because it was an error, and they have brought their offering, an offering by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and their sin offering before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", for their error. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all the congregation of the people of Israel shall be forgiven, and the stranger who sojourns among them, because the whole population was involved in the error.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.4.2+LEV.4.3+LEV.4.4+LEV.4.5+LEV.4.6+LEV.4.7+LEV.4.8+LEV.4.9+LEV.4.10+LEV.4.11+LEV.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 4.2-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “If one person sins unwittingly, he shall offer a female goat a year old for a sin offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall make atonement before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for the person who commits an error, when he sins unwittingly, to make atonement for him; and he shall be forgiven. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall have one law for him who does anything unwittingly, for him who is native among the people of Israel, and for the stranger who sojourns among them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the person who does anything with a high hand, whether he is native or a sojourner, reviles the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and that person shall be cut off from among his people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because he has despised the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and has broken his commandment, that person shall be utterly cut off; his iniquity shall be upon him.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While the people of Israel were in the wilderness, they found a man gathering sticks on the sabbath day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And those who found him gathering sticks brought him to Moses and Aaron, and to all the congregation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They put him in custody, because it had not been made plain what should be done to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “The man shall be put to death; all the congregation shall stone him with stones outside the camp.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all the congregation brought him outside the camp, and stoned him to death with stones, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
