        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.22.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 22.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Speak to the people of Israel, and bid them to make tassels on the corners of their garments throughout their generations, and to put upon the tassel of each corner a cord of blue; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and it shall be to you a tassel to look upon and remember all the commandments of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to do them, not to follow after your own heart and your own eyes, which you are inclined to go after wantonly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So you shall remember and do all my commandments, and be holy to your God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt, to be your God: I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
